    </div>
    <div class="process">
      <div class="step"><div class="tag">01</div><div><b>Discovery and business case</b><p>Identify the reporting bottleneck, the current effort and the outcome management wants to improve.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="tag">02</div><div><b>Data and systems audit</b><p>Map the applications, spreadsheets, permissions and data sources involved in the reporting.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="tag">03</div><div><b>KPI definitions and governance</b><p>Agree the calculation logic, access rules and validation checks so numbers are consistent.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="tag">04</div><div><b>Build and test</b><p>Model the data and build the Power BI reporting, then test it against realistic scenarios.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="tag">05</div><div><b>Launch and measure</b><p>Roll out partner and CFO views and track whether reporting effort and decision speed improve.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

